  "description": "Two storey side and rear extension; single storey rear extension; alterations to roof to form end gable and rear dormer; installation of two rooflights in front roof slope ",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The proposed two storey side extension, together with the proposed gable end roof, and the intersection created between the two, would result in an inappropriate roof form which is considered an unduly obtrusive and incongruous addition to the original dwellinghouse which would fail to respect the character and proportions of the dwellinghouse and the visual amenities of the locality and therefore would be contrary to the high quality design aspiration of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 (D.1 and D.11) of The London Plan (2021), Policies GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041) and the relevant provisions of the adopted Harrow Supplementary Planning Document Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
